0..75 Comment "// A package\'s hidden type cannot leak: a consumer that returns the seed at"
76..149 Comment "// the hidden type `T` as an `Integer` is refused. The lowering admits no"
150..224 Comment "// package type, `pack` or `unpack` yet (#1108), so that refusal stands in"
225..246 Comment "// front of the leak."
